From: Silicon Bakery AVE port (rebase only)
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec/v4l2_m2m_enc: aquarat AVE series 0001-0007, rebased onto FFmpeg n9.0.1

The seven patches of github.com/aquarat/apple-m-series-ave-driver ffmpeg/patches
(commit 9ab14e45281e8f61fb499b760408028171a5f2b5, made for n8.1), applied in order
to n9.0.1 (bf1b838f2ab8). 0001-0005 apply as is; 0006 needed fuzz for one
include hunk (n9.0.1 added libavutil/attributes.h), 0007 then applied cleanly.
Combined into one diff. Authorship and licence: the original series (LGPL-2.1+).
Not compiled here.

---
